		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020120"},
		line=935,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teeeeeei!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A sharp voice rends apart the morning air.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I barely manage to sidestep her overhand strike.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Hotori isn’t acting like herself this morning.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"She's just swinging her practice blade around with brute strength, completely oblivious to all the openings she's leaving.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"There's not so much as a trace of her usual poise.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I keep her in check with a wide, defensive swing and take my distance.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I should be asking you that. This isn't your usual bladework.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did anything happen?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Hotori pauses for a moment, slowly raising her blade aloft with both hands.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks for letting me play housewife all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But starting today, I'm not gonna make breakfast anymore. No more miso tofu.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold up, wait, how could─!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"We finish training and bow to each other.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Hotori is covered in sweat, the steam slowly drifting off her body in the cool morning air.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, what's the matter with you today?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Even Akari's picked up on how strangely Hotori is acting.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Last night, Maki turned in his resignation to me.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He did?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's what he went to go do after that?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You met him yesterday?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, we ran into him on the streets. Still, I can't believe\nhe'd resign...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What was his reason?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“One was that he's opposed to rescuing my father.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The other was...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Hotori trails off.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...that I'm unfit to be chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's that supposed to mean?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine. He's not wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Hotori says, shaking her head as she puts on a weak smile.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"It seems a lot happened between her and Maki.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is Maki gonna take the Koubukan's disciples with him?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It doesn't look like he's told them anything yet.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He really went and resigned by himself on a whim? What the heck is with that guy?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Considering his usual conduct, you'd expect him to walk out with his whole faction in tow.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"What is he playing at here?",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you told anyone else about Maki?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not yet.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then let's keep it under wraps for now.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The warriors of the Koubukan might very well follow in his footsteps.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You wanna buy time to talk some sense into him?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's the plan.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if we can't bring him back, we need to at least keep track of what he's up to.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Maki knows too much about the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"If a fraction of that intel falls into the wrong hands, we could see a repeat of the August Incident.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's split up and search for Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Five days since Maki turned in his resignation.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"We kept up our search during every waking moment, but\nwe've found neither hide nor hair of him.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Right as the three of us are about to throw in the towel─",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"We receive an e-mail from the manager saying, “I saw Maki leaving Miyoshi.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Despite it being such a late hour that even the drunkards have gone home, Akari, Hotori, and I rush down to Miyoshi at once.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh my, Soujin-sama? Welcome.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san greets us with her usual smile.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Fortunately, it looks like the last of her customers have already left.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh dear. It's almost closing time, so I'm afraid I don't have very much left in the way of ingredients.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine. We didn't come to eat today.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But you must be quite famished, yes?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"She peers up at me with a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Of course, I really am quite hungry.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh, I almost forgot. I prepared some rice balls earlier for a midnight snack.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please do help yourself to them.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama and Akari-sama, please, there is plenty for you two as well.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Hearing this, the pair finally poke their heads out from behind me.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Swept up by Mutsumi-san's hospitality, we eagerly dig in to the rice balls.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"It's a simple meal of white rice covered with an outer layer of crispy small fry, but it's startlingly delicious.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"The fragrant, salty flavor breathes a second wind into my exhausted body. ",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The three of us clean the entire plate in silence.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“There are few things that make me happier than folks looking like they're enjoying their meal.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We only ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"look",
{"/font"},
" like it because it truly is delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehehee, a rare compliment from Soujin-sama for a dish other than my tofu.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do I really only ever compliment you on your tofu?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, only ever tofu.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"...How can that be, I wonder?",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Isn't all of Mutsumi-san's food delicious?",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“And so, what brings you upon my doorstep?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san asks as she serves us tea.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could you please tell us about Maki?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That will be a rather long story...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Would you mind waiting a while longer? I'm afraid I need to tidy up the restaurant first.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please, let me help.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, same here!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I couldn't possibly ask...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Consider it payment for the meal.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Splitting up, we assist with closing up Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Akari and Hotori move to go clean up the dining area.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Mutsumi-san and I begin washing a large stack of dishes.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“My serving girls went home early today, so your presence is a big help.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, if anything, we're the ones imposing on you.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san turns to smile at me.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"All the while, she continues to move through dish after dish at a dizzying pace.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“What might be the matter with Kazuma-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He turned in his resignation the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"For the briefest of moments, Mutsumi-san's hands freeze in place.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We want to talk to him, so we've been looking for him ever since.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The manager said he was here.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He was indeed here until around two hours ago.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But I'm afraid I don't know where he might have gone.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He came to eat at Miyoshi?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed. He arrived earlier in the evening to enjoy some food and drink.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“After that, he rested in the tatami room for a spell before departing.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He hardly ever pays me any patronage, so I was rather startled to see him.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did he say anything to you?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He certainly had plenty of choice words about the quality of my cooking.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“All evening long, it was nothing but, 'This crap is underseasoned, this here is burnt to a crisp...'”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How rude of him...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehehee, well, it is Kazuma-sama after all.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san smiles pleasantly at the memory, not seeming the least bit offended.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why might Kazuma-sama have resigned?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“From what I understand, it seems he and Hotori-sama had a difference of opinion regarding Kokuan-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Word sure travels fast.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Honestly, we also want to know why he resigned.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I don't have an answer.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“However, I have faith that he is thinking about the future of the Sworn Blades, in his own way.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't imagine Maki's methods are good for the Blades' future.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hence, 'in his own way.'”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san pensively runs her finger across the rim of a rugged earthenware plate, her gaze someplace far in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“When we formed the Sworn Blades, Kokuan-sama, Kazuma-sama, and I all swore an oath together.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“'We of the Three Founders shall join forces and fight side by side until the day the Empire is restored.'”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I may have forsworn our oath, but I'm certain that Kazuma-sama still remembers it, even now.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He is admirably straightforward, sometimes to the point of foolishness.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's words overflow with a steadfast trust in Maki.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"There must be some deeper connection between the two of them that I don't know about.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If the three of you swore that oath together, why did you leave the Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Because I thought even warriors should be able to lead the lives they wish to.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If all three heads of the Founders remain as part of the Blades, then nobody would be able to resign without feeling ashamed, right?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That is why I took the initiative and withdrew.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You would not be wrong to reprove me as a coward, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I still don't understand.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you swore that oath, then why didn't either you or Maki step up to become the chairman?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I also thought Kazuma-sama should have succeeded Kokuan-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But there was a good reason he could not.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"This is news to me.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I would ask that you keep what I'm about to tell you to yourself, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It is because of what happened during the August Incident.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That incident only came to pass in the first place because someone leaked the information about our planned uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Our staging point before the uprising was leaked to the Republican Army, and they ambushed us all there.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As for who was responsible for leaking this information, nobody knows to this day... correct?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes, it remains a mystery.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The matter was settled with the assumption that they were either arrested or killed.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Wait, it can't be...",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san offers an understanding smile at my uneasy expression.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It was not Kazuma-sama, but rather, one of his disciples within the Koubukan.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He was deceived by a woman in the employ of the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Unbelievable...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Suddenly, I remember Maki's warning to me.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“A warrior has no need of romance.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Try heading down that primrose path, and you'll only lose your way.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Make sure you remember that, To-ki-ta.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"So that's what you meant, Maki.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, what happened to that warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He left his last will and testament to Kazuma-sama and took his own life.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Out of a sense of responsibility, Kazuma-sama refused to become chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“On top of that, he knew that he could not publicize the\ntraitor's identity.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If the Inou faction were to find out, they would have surely denounced the Maki faction and caused a schism within the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And if that happened, our power as a whole would be diminished.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed. With the arrest of Kokuan-sama, the fate of the Blades was resting on a knife's edge. Add the turmoil of an internal conflict, and it would have been all over.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe that is why Kazuma-sama remained with the Blades, even despite his desire to atone for his own negligence.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Hidden behind the front of his abrasive temperament, Maki has always had the Blades’ best interests at heart this entire time...",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If that's the sort of person Maki is, then resigning out of hatred for Kokuan-dono must just be a pretext.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe it is exactly as you say.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He is but a terribly graceless gentleman after all, and it can be difficult to divine his true intentions.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“He's caused me no end of trouble because of that...”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"In this moment, Mutsumi-san looks for all the world like an elder sister scolding a mischievous younger brother.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Despite her helplessly affectionate smile, however, I have a sense that there's much more to the story that she isn't able to tell me.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you for telling me about all this.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“No, I just wanted someone to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I hope it might save the Sworn Blades... And even before that, Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As much as we may want to do so, Kazuma-sama and I are still the heads of our own houses, so we cannot afford to be seen offering her our unconditional support.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“What Hotori-sama needs, more than anything, is a comrade who will always stand by her side.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've always been trying to support her. I made a promise with Kokuan-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“However, I truly believe that Hotori has what it takes to lead the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only she had some more confidence in herself, she'd be able to stand all on her own.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san listens to my declaration with a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But, it seems like she still isn't able to move past what happened with the Myougi Squad.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe that is only to be expected.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"All her subordinates in the Myougi Squad faithfully followed their captain unto battle.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"But in the end, the only person that survived was her.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"How could Hotori help but blame herself?",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"I sneak a glance at Hotori as she cleans the dining area.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"She and Akari are carrying several buckets to be dumped outside.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"There's no way that she doesn't think back to that day every single time she exercises her authority as the leader of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Her fixation on calling herself the “acting” chairman and her insistence on rescuing Kokuan-dono are manifestations of this anxiety.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Hotori surely believes, without a shadow of a doubt, that\nshe's not up to the task of serving as chairman.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The human heart is a complex thing.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Having to think my way out of problems is so much harder than solving problems with my blade.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Even when I try my best, the only words of comfort I manage to come up with are terribly clumsy.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"If only I were able to be as considerate as Mutsumi-san or the manager.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She lost confidence in herself because we were defeated, so the only way to restore that confidence is through seizing a victory.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Words of encouragement will only do so much. Unless she engraves that confidence upon her own heart, it'll crumble apart when she needs it most.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehehee, what a demanding fellow you are.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But, I believe there is indeed a half-truth to what you said.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about the other half?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe that convincing her you will always be by her side would also help to build up her faith in herself.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know I'm not the tactful sort of man capable of finding the right words for that.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“What you need are not words. Especially not from one warrior to another.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san declares, her emerald eyes staring into my own.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, the blade may convey that which mere words cannot.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I believe all your feelings will reach her as soon as you face the enemy with your backs only to each other.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"─The blade may convey that which mere words cannot.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san's words settle into my warrior's heart, as though they've been there the whole time.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Yes, this is a method more suited to me.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd sooner die than ever leave Hotori’s side.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san silently gives me a satisfied nod.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
